opped black denim jacket, black inner camisole, high‑waisted black denim trousers. Her facial identity, hair color‑streaks, costume must stay consistent across every shot. Remove all watermarks, text logos. Scene: riverside city promenade at night, bright full moon overhead, city skyscraper bokeh lights, river reflecting city lights and moonlight, white metal railing, cool night ambient atmosphere, cinematic night lighting, shallow depth of field.\n\n### Summary\n\n[reference generation] Exact 20‑second melancholic cinematic music video,9:16 vertical. Subject1 stays alone on night riverside promenade, **singing continuously non‑stop from 0‑20s**, natural rhythmic lip‑jaw‑throat‑chest breathing movement for singing. Each shot uses unique camera angle + brand‑new unrepeated action, rich shifting facial emotions, partial eye‑contact interaction with camera. Actions: lean against railing, walk along riverbank, stop to gaze at water, brush hair in breeze, lean on stone embankment, slow side tracking shot, final quiet close‑up. No duplicated poses or movements. Lonely sentimental urban‑night mood, soft moonlight rim‑lighting, sad cinematic backing score.\n\n### Retention Analysis\n\nSubject1 present for full 20‑second runtime. Facial features, two‑tone hair, black denim full outfit fully preserved. Hard rule: **never stop singing in any shot**, lips maintain rhythmic singing motion, chest and shoulders rise and fall with vocal breath. Unique non‑repeating actions: lean on railing, forward riverside walking, stare at river surface, wind‑blown hair gesture, rest on stone embankment, side profile tracking, final still close‑up. Emotion transitions: pensive longing → suppressed sorrow → distant wistfulness → weary soft melancholy. No repeated poses, no repeated camera‑gaze loops.\n\n### Detailed Description\n\nExact 20‑second vertical 9:16 cinematic music video, multiple smooth edited shots. Environment: night riverside walkway, glowing full moon, shimmering river water reflecting city lamp bokeh, white guardrail, distant glowing high‑rise buildings, cool blue‑toned night lighting, soft film grain, subtle night mist haze. No flowers, fantasy special effects. Slow emotional cutting rhythm, soft seamless transitions only.\n\n#### Shot1 Medium shot, lean against railing｜00:00‑00:03\n\nVideo opens with medium shot. Subject1 leans one hand on white riverside railing, body tilts slightly. Moonlight draws soft rim‑light on her two‑tone long hair. **She starts singing immediately, lips rhythmically open‑close, jaw and throat move naturally, chest rises and falls with singing breath**. She glances sideways toward camera, eyes carry pensive longing, faint glistening in eyes. Background shows moon and shimmering river reflection.\n\n#### Shot2 Full‑body long shot, walking forward along river｜00:03‑00:07\n\nCut to full‑body long shot, camera follows slightly behind‑side. **Singing continues without pause**. She pushes off the railing and walks slowly forward along the riverside path. Night breeze lifts strands of her hair. She does not look back toward camera; gaze drifts toward distant city lightscape. Leg stride, body sway from walking is brand‑new action, no repetition with leaning pose. Wide frame captures river, city night bokeh, full moon in sky.\n\n#### Shot3 Medium‑close shot, stop & gaze down at river water｜00:07‑00:10\n\nCut to medium‑close shot. She halts walking, stands at river edge. One hand hangs loosely by side. **Keeps singing**. She tilts head down, stares quietly at rippling reflective river surface. Profile face illuminated by moon glow, facial expression shifts to suppressed sorrow, brows faintly soften. This stationary downward‑gaze action is distinct from leaning and walking.\n\n#### Shot4 Upper‑body shot, brush wind‑blown hair｜00:10‑00:13\n\nCut to upper‑body framing. Cool night wind blows across scene. **Still singing**. She lifts one hand gently to brush disheveled two‑tone hair away from her cheek, fingers skim hair strands. She lifts her face upward toward the bright full moon, wistful distant expression, only briefly flickers eyes toward camera once. Hand‑to‑hair gesture is a new unique physical action.\n\n#### Shot5 Side tracking shot, lean on stone embankment｜00:13‑00:16\n\nCut to smooth lateral side‑tracking camera. She moves a short distance, rests hip against low stone river embankment, arms loosely crossed in front of torso. **Never stops singing**. Camera glides sideways capturing her full side‑three‑quarter silhouette, moonlight outlines denim jacket texture. Emotion reads as quiet weariness; she looks out over the city skyline, no repeated leaning‑on‑railing pose.\n\n#### Shot6 Final emotional close‑up｜00:16‑00:20\n\nCut to final tight close‑up of her face and shoulder area. She stands unmoving by embankment. **Continues singing until final frame**. Moonlight falls across half her face. She slowly turns eyes to meet camera for one last quiet moment, melancholy weary soft expression. Hold this emotional frame to end video.\n\n### Soundscape\n\nSubject1’s continuous singing, faint night‑wind ambient sound, soft distant city hum, subtle fabric rustle of denim jacket. No intelligible human lyrics, no dialogue, no spoken speech.\n\n### Non‑Diegetic Music\n\nMelancholic sparse backing track, tempo 56BPM. Gentle piano arpeggios, sustained soft string violin, muted atmospheric pad. Music volume low at start, emotional intensity builds during walking and embankment shots, resolves on soft suspended chord at ending. No human vocal layers, no abrupt cut‑off.\n\n### Forbidden Elements\n\nNo flowers, petals, dust, magical glows, fantasy special effects. No subtitles, text, watermarks, logos, extra people, shaky camera, harsh jump cuts. **Strictly prohibit character from stopping singing at any timestamp**. Forbid repeated actions: no repeated railing leans, no repeated turning‑back to camera, no duplicated standing poses"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "la